{"w":2400,"h":3209,"lines":[{"h":0.016546687901577095,"t":"Audioscripts","c":1,"x":0.081488039784565744,"y":0.047685958360733305,"w":0.1205190658569336},{"c":1,"t":"YOUNG WOMAN:","w":0.1106796137491862,"h":0.0088042455298878997,"x":0.085436892057445757,"y":0.098753894052619362},{"x":0.19601238885148453,"y":0.092374964915165836,"w":0.50313385009765621,"c":1,"h":0.019867463869469248,"t":"Yes, and ultimately, they didn't achieve anything. And anyway,"},{"x":0.2077669853307513,"t":"industrialisation created more jobs than it destroyed.","y":0.11046511656793323,"h":0.014534883112922281,"c":1,"w":0.41747573852539055},{"x":0.085436894153988988,"t":"YOUNG MAN.","y":0.13226744179550176,"w":0.089320386250813802,"h":0.0088540534735468412,"c":1},{"x":0.20951098747720437,"y":0.12241365532000326,"w":0.61203226725260418,"h":0.023305582777361944,"t":"Yes, that's true - but it probably didn't seem a positive thing at the time. I can","c":1},{"t":"see why the Luddites felt so threatened.","x":0.20953454748113104,"y":0.14282726691868164,"c":1,"w":0.31871640523274741,"h":0.016486374091507883},{"t":"YOUNG WOMAN:","x":0.085436898587322507,"h":0.011664130903107361,"c":1,"y":0.16279069760498543,"w":0.10873785654703774},{"h":0.019538986942849834,"t":"I know. I'm sure I would have felt the same. The discussion about the future","y":0.15731977574484579,"w":0.59832717895507814,"x":0.20765922744589421,"c":1},{"h":0.019600448133046733,"x":0.20955855769450862,"t":"of work was really optimistic for a change. I like the idea that work won't","y":0.17330389845159844,"w":0.56538569132486982,"c":1},{"w":0.6002916971842448,"y":0.18962740598786154,"t":"involve doing boring, repetitive tasks, as robots will do all that. Normally, you","x":0.2076429382772117,"h":0.020893762416186012,"c":1},{"w":0.3208482869466146,"h":0.020224463679708871,"c":1,"t":"only hear negative stuff about the future.","x":0.20942714713277041,"y":0.20653158510854075},{"c":1,"t":"Bit too optimistic, don't you think? For example, I can't see how people are","w":0.58873143513997395,"y":0.22121693547011467,"h":0.0221290754751996,"x":0.21145488635691018},{"h":0.017995282942632307,"c":1,"y":0.23946891534230885,"x":0.20959818372834832,"w":0.58465240478515623,"t":"about to have more leisure time, when all the evidence shows people are"},{"w":0.2780789184570312,"y":0.25681037518848659,"c":1,"x":0.20947615397926866,"t":"spending longer than ever at work.","h":0.017413239761305044},{"w":0.104854367574056,"y":0.27757009353953599,"t":"YOUNG WOMAN:","x":0.085436893787619345,"h":0.0087671158098356905,"c":1},{"h":0.0088676375392070517,"c":1,"x":0.087378640185799702,"t":"YOUNG MAN:","w":0.087378641764322904,"y":0.2934579439017253},{"w":0.1106796137491862,"h":0.011667753082940879,"y":0.30809968845936053,"t":"YOUNG WOMAN:","c":1,"x":0.087378641313109101},{"c":1,"x":0.21150434314756231,"w":0.61195749918619791,"h":0.019918330659004724,"t":"No - that's true. And what about lower unemployment? I'm not so sure about that.","y":0.27042414880995136},{"h":0.01790148120060131,"c":1,"t":"Perhaps in the long term - but not in the foreseeable future.","y":0.28815696608672359,"x":0.21153848459354918,"w":0.47399388631184891},{"h":0.01921931590618009,"y":0.30292745791626496,"x":0.21151042500144693,"c":1,"t":"Mmm. And I expect most people will be expected to work until they're much","w":0.59641555786132816},{"t":"older - as everyone's living much longer.","w":0.32427182515462238,"h":0.016025501619618243,"y":0.32118380040937988,"c":1,"x":0.2116504950197762},{"w":0.087378641764322904,"y":0.34143302156037958,"x":0.087378640188006215,"t":"YOUNG MAN:","h":0.010311164737119127,"c":1},{"x":0.21165048515836049,"w":0.20776699066162108,"t":"That's already happening.","y":0.3386292834521426,"h":0.014641744548286595,"c":1},{"x":0.087378640639969987,"t":"YOUNG WOMAN:","w":0.11067961374918621,"h":0.010174417941369862,"y":0.37936046534617551,"c":1},{"h":0.018989003261673187,"c":1,"y":0.37374533051815817,"t":"I enjoyed all that stuff on how technology has changed some jobs and how","x":0.20961524611808405,"w":0.59245264689127608},{"c":1,"x":0.21154331041096175,"w":0.33028121948242184,"y":0.39173452395868558,"t":"they're likely to change in the near future.","h":0.016867698835806744},{"c":1,"y":0.41277258552168816,"t":"YOUNG MAN:","x":0.087378640188006215,"w":0.087378641764322904,"h":0.0087390424306519332},{"c":1,"x":0.21154665063865052,"w":0.55363672892252602,"h":0.018875444121078444,"y":0.40579829287704361,"t":"Yeah, incredible. Like accountants. You might think all the technological"},{"t":"innovations would have put them out of a job, but in fact there are more of them","h":0.01969163306405608,"w":0.6157770792643229,"x":0.21153707949007752,"c":1,"y":0.42266382766689514},{"t":"than ever. They're still really in demand and have become far more efficient.","y":0.43787711248332006,"h":0.020225155316409227,"x":0.2114743942877404,"w":0.58676890055338538,"c":1},{"y":0.46074766377633902,"h":0.010280373831775824,"x":0.087378639641683312,"c":1,"t":"YOUNG WOMAN:","w":0.11067961374918621},{"h":0.020378976744654831,"y":0.45367572938711942,"x":0.21343133304103049,"t":"Right. That was amazing. Twenty times more accountants in this country","c":1,"w":0.57314315795898441},{"y":0.4738317756904793,"t":"compared to the 19th century.","w":0.23883494059244792,"h":0.014641744548286706,"c":1,"x":0.21359223854566228},{"c":1,"w":0.089320386250813816,"x":0.087378643055822824,"t":"YOUNG MAN:","y":0.49273255830160201,"h":0.01017441794136964},{"c":1,"t":"I know. I'd never have thought that demand for hairdressing would have gone","w":0.61191151936848964,"y":0.48681578749204379,"h":0.01887210061616984,"x":0.21151877151191645},{"x":0.21153673467956405,"t":"up so much in the last hundred years. One hairdresser for every 287 people","c":1,"y":0.50252521212808476,"w":0.60218093872070311,"h":0.019404187306436782},{"w":0.29929560343424477,"c":1,"y":0.52146153673819606,"t":"now, compared to one for over 1,500.","x":0.21344159253544404,"h":0.018035191093278446},{"w":0.10873785654703776,"t":"YOUNG WOMAN:","y":0.54069767439762106,"h":0.011638774455893452,"c":1,"x":0.089320393279879132},{"y":0.53438902854969172,"t":"Yeah because people's earning power has gone up so they can afford to","w":0.57508178710937496,"x":0.21341565334909404,"h":0.020909023582006858,"c":1},{"h":0.016594565323208688,"c":1,"y":0.55414634447770283,"t":"spend more on personal services like that.","x":0.21343969880414762,"w":0.33620707194010413},{"h":0.010295768690257723,"c":1,"t":"YOUNG MAN:","y":0.5741279072357105,"x":0.089320389814953716,"w":0.089320386250813816},{"y":0.59003115265804018,"t":"YOUNG WOMAN:","x":0.08932038888592464,"h":0.010280373831775713,"w":0.1106796137491862,"c":1},{"x":0.21343865710755325,"w":0.44691808064778638,"y":0.56814828206968293,"h":0.019754305212668521,"t":"But technology hasn't changed the actual job that much.","c":1},{"w":0.58482915242513012,"t":"No, they've got hairdryers, etc. but it's one job where you don't depend on","y":0.58384500703679187,"c":1,"h":0.022555843840506906,"x":0.21344166459362632},{"c":1,"w":0.5711661275227865,"x":0.21344923169910979,"y":0.60021573883876267,"h":0.019596549060857171,"t":"a computer... The kind of work that administrative staff do has changed"},{"h":0.018489487074617283,"t":"enormously, thanks to technology. Even 20 years ago there were secretaries","c":1,"y":0.61727071161323022,"x":0.21539953837805911,"w":0.60415364583333331},{"x":0.21553398190316586,"w":0.20970873514811195,"c":1,"y":0.63662790726677243,"h":0.01453488311292217,"t":"doing dictation and typing."},{"x":0.089320389301777561,"w":0.089320386250813802,"y":0.65545171332880336,"h":0.010280373831775713,"c":1,"t":"YOUNG MAN:"},{"x":0.21538121959365469,"t":"Yes. Really boring compared to these days, when they're given much more","y":0.64825623200847382,"c":1,"w":0.59448389689127601,"h":0.020618723931713601},{"w":0.25631067911783856,"h":0.014641744548286595,"x":0.21359223318296222,"t":"responsibility and higher status.","c":1,"y":0.66853582528808753},{"c":1,"y":0.68750000011398316,"t":"YOUNG WOMAN:","w":0.11262135823567709,"h":0.011627906728013726,"x":0.089320388746239127},{"t":"Mmm. A lot of graduates go in for this kind of work now... I'd expected there","x":0.21539845415249223,"w":0.60414855957031244,"h":0.01902186788873883,"c":1,"y":0.68134018221609405},{"x":0.21345745188568363,"y":0.69734144420786415,"w":0.56919769287109367,"h":0.019241290226160945,"t":"to be a much bigger change in the number of agricultural workers in the","c":1},{"t":"19th century. But the 1871 census showed that roughly 25% of the population","x":0.21536092644938246,"w":0.61395909627278644,"y":0.71220384990111818,"h":0.02158515431056518,"c":1},{"y":0.73255813965720162,"w":0.16116504669189455,"c":1,"x":0.21553398240647995,"h":0.014534883112922281,"t":"worked on the land."},{"w":0.091262137095133478,"x":0.089320388442724497,"h":0.011679525761589371,"t":"YOUNG MAN:","c":1,"y":0.75140186934660336},{"t":"YOUNG WOMAN:","w":0.11067961374918621,"h":0.01032655900141155,"c":1,"y":0.76728971963497095,"x":0.091262135785601065},{"y":0.78329388557880708,"w":0.089383316040039074,"c":1,"h":0.01190060054030373,"t":"YOUNG MAN:","x":0.091230673305774695},{"t":"Yeah, I'd have assumed it would be more than 50%. Now it's less than 0.2%.","x":0.21536928675575154,"h":0.021139562018563818,"y":0.74523280152033144,"c":1,"w":0.60417149861653652},{"h":0.015061521084509089,"c":1,"t":"What about care workers?","w":0.21386349995930989,"y":0.7644495319035659,"x":0.21347797270815136},{"y":0.77759444693985746,"c":1,"w":0.57897216796875006,"x":0.2173177393561079,"t":"They barely existed in the 19th century as people's lifespan was so much","h":0.02007512600622452},{"y":0.79493575375043657,"c":1,"w":0.47009689331054688,"t":"shorter. But now of course this sector will see huge growth.","h":0.018139892055238138,"x":0.21541373376957779},{"w":0.1106796137491862,"c":1,"t":"YOUNG WOMAN:","y":0.81682243017365985,"h":0.010280373831775602,"x":0.091262134775892317},{"c":1,"w":0.60026891072591149,"t":"Yeah - and it's hard enough to meet current demand. The future looks quite","y":0.80988405747301273,"h":0.020057321708893183,"x":0.21541011140778976},{"c":1,"t":"bleak for bank clerks. They've been in decline since ATMs were introduced in","x":0.21732999678783452,"w":0.60997502644856771,"y":0.82635478688555952,"h":0.01804145147495928},{"c":1,"x":0.21545702606665193,"w":0.10112478256225585,"t":"the eighties.","y":0.84707946939946899,"h":0.015143386745749998},{"w":0.091262130737304686,"y":0.86479750769808661,"h":0.011655980404292277,"t":"YOUNG MAN:","c":1,"x":0.089320391694454437},{"c":1,"x":0.21729160609217946,"w":0.59836039225260418,"t":"And technology will certainly make most of the jobs they do now redundant,","y":0.85809251812688447,"h":0.020914762265214271},{"w":0.05963991165161131,"h":0.014321134097850963,"x":0.2148907595452153,"c":1,"y":0.87867318310291498,"t":"I think."},{"t":"YOUNG WOMAN:","y":0.89813084134732313,"x":0.09320388080554555,"w":0.10873786926269531,"h":0.010299391464280938,"c":1},{"h":0.020526639991831575,"c":1,"x":0.21347436968789718,"y":0.89106320659590987,"w":0.57894073486328135,"t":"I agree, although the situation may change. It's very hard to predict what"},{"w":0.097961686452229829,"h":0.01437209476934409,"x":0.21707155860083019,"c":1,"t":"will happen.","y":0.91223015168289112},{"c":1,"h":0.013848084304191599,"x":0.84840287772954226,"y":0.091186422941183176,"t":"Q21\/22","w":0.06241754531860344},{"w":0.062612406412760446,"y":0.12411157659137084,"c":1,"t":"Q21\/22","h":0.013406903275819615,"x":0.84826815951557966},{"t":"Q23\/24","h":0.015200439643265673,"c":1,"y":0.23664164746490124,"x":0.84794835377177435,"w":0.063332328796386728},{"t":"Q23\/24","w":0.062196076711018899,"x":0.84851361203587528,"h":0.013241649639569308,"c":1,"y":0.27026871004307984},{"c":1,"x":0.85048543751739314,"w":0.036893202463785801,"h":0.01308139551465759,"t":"Q25","y":0.42151162778559192},{"t":"Q26","y":0.53488372080884772,"h":0.013081395514657479,"x":0.8504854374653873,"c":1,"w":0.038834950129191137},{"y":0.64825581383210362,"c":1,"x":0.85242718503820281,"w":0.038834950129191026,"t":"Q27","h":0.01308139551465759},{"y":0.74563953476447342,"w":0.036893202463785801,"c":1,"h":0.01308139551465759,"t":"Q28","x":0.85436893265699609},{"w":0.036893202463785801,"h":0.01308139551465759,"t":"Q29","c":1,"x":0.85436893266302438,"y":0.79360465104140576},{"h":0.013081395514657479,"c":1,"t":"Q30","x":0.85631068021902401,"y":0.85901162778772933,"w":0.036893202463785801},{"w":0.036893202463785815,"c":1,"h":0.014534883112922281,"x":0.09320388437490322,"t":"112","y":0.9636627908199924}]}